You are currently studying towards an undergraduate degree;

You want to combine your interest in cricket with cutting-edge sports technology;

You want your work to support officiating and/or cricket broadcast analysis;

You’re excited by working behind the scenes on live cricket matches;

You are able to stay calm and focused when the pressure is on;

You take pride in accuracy and getting the details right;

You enjoy practical problem-solving;

You enjoy working in a close-knit team;

You’re curious about technology and keen to learn new skills;

You’re comfortable with travel, irregular hours and time away from home;

You take responsibility for your work and respond positively to feedback.

